{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans","id":960290,"title":"Pitch me your Azoth 10 Prometheans","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-30T01:12:00-07:00","id":960290,"title":"Pitch me your Azoth 10 Prometheans","content":"So I'm always curious when I see the Power Stat (BLood Potency, Primal Urge, Gnosis, Azoth, etc.) table, about what an individual with a Power Stat of 10 would be like. All lines offer various challenges to such high power level, but for Promethean I think there's the additional one of explaining why such a powerful individual hasn't completed the pilgrimage yet.<br /> <br /> That being said, have you ever used or thought of an Azoth 10 Promethean in your game? I'd be curious to hear some ideas on the topic <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-30T07:19:05-07:00","id":960418,"title":"","content":"Azoth is orthogonal to progress on the Pilgrimage; that's solely reflected by the Pilgrimage trait and the number and variety of Roles you've completed. In fact, the downsides to high Azoth (notably, attracting Pandorans and triggering Firestorms) arguably make it harder to progress.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-30T11:12:17-07:00","id":960555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=960418#post960418\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Azoth is orthogonal to progress on the Pilgrimage</div> </div> </div> </div>It adds a precious die to the New Dawn roll and is the primary limiter on at least two of the more common manifestations of a universal milestone, as well as being part of both dicepools for Elpis visions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-30T11:17:00-07:00","id":960557,"title":"","content":"When I think high-powered Prometheans, I always think of this example NPC from Book of the Dead that's just a huge Pyramid Head-esque Frankenstein that lumbers around the Southwest looking for someone strong enough to defeat it in battle. Problem is, it's <i>really</i> strong, and so it just keeps killing the people and things that challenge it and getting even stronger, and it can't progress on the Pilgrimage because it hasn't achieved the Milestone of being beaten.<br /> <br /> A good question to ask when creating very powerful Promethean characters might be &quot;what is the step on the Pilgrimage that they haven't managed to take? Where are they stalled, what's standing in their way?&quot;<br /> <br /> e: As I was looking at rules with an eye to making a character, I realized that an Azoth 10 character is going to be creating massive, region-spanning Wastelands every time they:<ul><li>Go a day without achieving a Milestone or changing Refinements</li> <li>Spend 1 single point of Pyros in a scene</li> </ul><br /> And the Wasteland Festers every time they do those things again or spend a day in the same place, so there are going to be a lot of apocalyptic Firestorms in their wake. On the one hand, this is a cool hook and makes Azoth 10 Created suitably legendary and terrifying to track down, but you're also probably going to want to put them in Antarctica or the Empty Quarter moreso than say, a goth nightclub in NYC.<br /> <br /> Those effects <i>can</i> be mitigated with Benign Festering and Hovel, and being in a branded throng, if you want to include an Azoth 10 NPC in a more social way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 08-30-2016, 03:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-30T21:59:11-07:00","id":960876,"title":"","content":"My idea for an ancient Promethean in 1e was a Galatea with the Heart of Stone Bestowment or whatever (the one where you turn into a statue) that had Repute as being &quot;The Weeping Angel&quot;.<br /> Here's the notes on the sheet (complete with the obvious references)<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>My old Dalines sheet</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Athletics - Running<br /> &quot;I think the reason I'm still alive after all these years is because I do <a href=\"https://youtu.be/BAi4izfvXo4\" target=\"_blank\">an awful lot of running</a>.&quot;<br /> <br /> Persuasion - Reputation<br /> &quot;I've seen the world burn at least a hundred times now. I've fought on both sides of wars and seen a nation rise and others fall to rise again. I've seen enough death, and hurt, and sadness, and tonight, just once, <a href=\"https://youtu.be/jhklrve5xmw\" target=\"_blank\">everybody</a> is going to <a href=\"https://youtu.be/O7mv8FSJDnQ\" target=\"_blank\">live</a>.&quot;<br /> <br /> Intimidation - Reputation<br /> &quot;I am <a href=\"https://youtu.be/MGwFnj3pDz8\" target=\"_blank\">the Weeping Angel</a>. <a href=\"https://youtu.be/C4MPunubrnc\" target=\"_blank\">The Roving Pyroclasm</a>. I've burned monster nests to the ground and lead demons to death. I've brought up and torn apart villages and towns. I'm a walking storm. A nightmare on the lips of abominations among abominations. I'm over two hundred years old, born in a cemetery and death seems to follow in my wake. And you're standing in my way. <a href=\"https://youtu.be/8nM4VavHwkY\" target=\"_blank\">That is not a very safe place to be</a>.&quot;<br /> <br /> Repute - The Weeping Angel, The Roving Pyroclasm, The Lonely Statue, The Walking Storm<br /> Having lived a long life, the nameless Created has gathered a lot of names. He's been around for the Revolution, stowing away on a ship when the Declaration was sent to King George. He had a hand in the treaty at Appomattox, having fought on both sides of the Civil War. Getting away from America, he was there when Franz Ferdinand was shot, and walked the trenches, clearing out Pandorans created by overzealous Created during the war. By then, he'd already gotten a reputation, a man who refused to take up arms for either side--having gotten enough of bloodshed in the Americas</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"font-size:9px\">Man, some of that is really poorly written.</span><br /> As for &quot;how are you still not Human&quot;, it's simply a matter of worry, fear, and of wanting to be a Bodhisattva.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar421_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"421\" data-vbnamecard=\"421\">Dataweaver</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2207\" data-vbnamecard=\"2207\">Caladriu</a> You're forgetting that Prometheans can willingly lower their Azoth. Which really just kind of makes Hovel an unnecessary merit, or at least unnecessary to be ranked.<br /> Also, what Pyramid Head-esque Frankenstein? I don't remember anything like that in Book of the Dead, though Book of Pandora has a Sublimatus with an icosohedron for a head named The Kaiju.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":2998,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","user":"Aspel","date":". 08-31-2016, 10:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-30T22:29:08-07:00","id":960886,"title":"","content":"Could you provide a 2e page reference for that, please? Last I checked, Going to the Wastes (1e's method of lowering Azoth) didn't make it into 2e; so either I missed it, or 2e replaced it with some other method of lowering Azoth that I missed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-30T23:59:48-07:00","id":960922,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aspel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=960876#post960876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, what Pyramid Head-esque Frankenstein? I don't remember anything like that in Book of the Dead, though Book of Pandora has a Sublimatus with an icosohedron for a head named The Kaiju.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sparser details than presented, but it's on page 50 in the list of example non-SE characters that might know the keys to Avernian Gates:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> He wanders the American Southwest, though his name refers to a specific city. Known as the Ghost of Galveston, he\u2019s been searching for 200 years for someone tough enough to kill him and send him to the River of Death. In that time, he\u2019s had offers from beings he can\u2019t identify to open gateways that would lead to this river, and he remembers what he\u2019s been told almost flawlessly. He might share his knowledge, but this Promethean, older and more powerful than many of his kind ever become, is bitter, spiteful, and dangerous, and wants nothing more than a fight to the death \u2014 <u>his</u> death. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T01:11:58-07:00","id":960939,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar421_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"421\" data-vbnamecard=\"421\">Dataweaver</a> Page 168, Dampening the Fire. You suppress it to any level you want for 24 hours and then after that you can return it to full power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T03:11:33-07:00","id":960961,"title":"","content":"A friend and I looked at the new dawn rules and mused an Azoth 10 promethean. You see, being human wasnt enough, for it learned that humams strive to be better than themselves. It sought to be the best human--the platonic ideal of humanity. It walled the world for a hundred years before walking back from the dead. It achieved every role and wraught every transmutation into its form. All milestones were completed. This promethean maintained Pilgrimage 10, it cleaved so close to its goal.<br /> <br /> Then that promethean picked up its bucket of dice... rolled every single one... and not a single success.<br /> <br /> With every milestone completely achieved this Promethean has no idea how to continue on the pilgrimage. Over the years it became Centimani. It desperately *wants* to continue the pilgrimage, but it doesnt want to get locked in a role its completed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T07:56:03-07:00","id":961057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SoulGambit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=960961#post960961\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A friend and I looked at the new dawn rules and mused an Azoth 10 promethean. You see, being human wasnt enough, for it learned that humams strive to be better than themselves. It sought to be the best human--the platonic ideal of humanity. It walled the world for a hundred years before walking back from the dead. It achieved every role and wraught every transmutation into its form. All milestones were completed. This promethean maintained Pilgrimage 10, it cleaved so close to its goal.<br /> <br /> Then that promethean picked up its bucket of dice... rolled every single one... and not a single success.<br /> <br /> With every milestone completely achieved this Promethean has no idea how to continue on the pilgrimage. Over the years it became Centimani. It desperately *wants* to continue the pilgrimage, but it doesnt want to get locked in a role its completed.</div> </div> </div> </div>The notion that there is a finite number of milestones bothers me more than it should. Specially considering that reaching some understanding of why he failed, or leaving the Path of Flux would be the next chance for the New Dawn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T08:31:28-07:00","id":961069,"title":"","content":"I'd go with the notion that failing the New Dawn check \u201cresets\u201d part of the Pilgrimage, leaving one or more Roles to be mastered once more, with new Milestones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T09:02:59-07:00","id":961077,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aspel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=960939#post960939\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> Page 168, Dampening the Fire. You suppress it to any level you want for 24 hours and then after that you can return it to full power.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, there you go. That <i>does</i> pretty much render Hovel moot, doesn't it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T09:10:38-07:00","id":961079,"title":"","content":"oh what would a (Stereotypical) Galateid with Azoth 10 look like?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T09:24:49-07:00","id":961086,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=961077#post961077\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, there you go. That <i>does</i> pretty much render Hovel moot, doesn't it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not necessarily. Hovel still comes with a Safe Place, time spent in one doesn't count towards causing or festering a Wasteland, and it doesn't come with the -3 Social penalty with other Created. Dampening the Fire doesn't help with any of that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T12:15:12-07:00","id":961156,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=961079#post961079\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">oh what would a (Stereotypical) Galateid with Azoth 10 look like?</div> </div> </div> </div>It must be someone who creates absolute hysteria from being present, like the biggest movie/music stars in a packed place. Not someone I'd like to be,<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T16:10:22-07:00","id":961274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=961057#post961057\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The notion that there is a finite number of milestones bothers me more than it should. Specially considering that reaching some understanding of why he failed, or leaving the Path of Flux would be the next chance for the New Dawn.</div> </div> </div> </div>There might be, but discovering it would be participating in the pilgrimage. Hes centimani, so he can't look into it and must reject all attempts to redeem him. He wont participate in a role hes completed long enough to get &quot;trapped&quot; in a role.<br /> <br /> By default he's an antagonist meant to be redeemed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T23:39:20-07:00","id":961477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=961086#post961086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not necessarily. Hovel still comes with a Safe Place, time spent in one doesn't count towards causing or festering a Wasteland, and it doesn't come with the -3 Social penalty with other Created. Dampening the Fire doesn't help with any of that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hovel <i>requires</i> Safe Space, it doesn't come with it; and It's a -3 penalty to identify her by Azoth, not a social penalty. Hovel isn't useless, because you can still sit in it and prevent Wasteland and Festering, but the ranked aspect of it is only useful in the likely rare situation you'd want to suppress your Azoth for less than 24 hours, then grab it from your hidey hole.<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar10272_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"10272\" data-vbnamecard=\"10272\">Daigotsu Max</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1153\" data-vbnamecard=\"1153\">Prince of the Night</a> being Azoth 10 wouldn't really make you look any different, save for the natural 'aura' of someone who's seen some shit. That said, if they didn't suppress their Azoth, yes, I could see people becoming obsessively jealous and suffering from Lisztomania, or simply being yandere.<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12191_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12191\" data-vbnamecard=\"12191\">Malus</a>, and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar421_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"421\" data-vbnamecard=\"421\">Dataweaver</a> I suppose: There are numerous Milestones, and they don't need to be planned out in advance. Besides completing a Role on your Pilgrimage, nothing has a set Magnitude, and so you could have Superlative Milestones even if you've completed a hundred Milestones.<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1157\" data-vbnamecard=\"1157\">SoulGambit</a> Well you implied he was Centimanus <i>because</i> he had completed &quot;all his Milestones&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T10:23:10-07:00","id":962355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daigotsu Max</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=961156#post961156\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It must be someone who creates absolute hysteria from being present, like the biggest movie/music stars in a packed place. Not someone I'd like to be,</div> </div> </div> </div>wait,does disquiet gets stronger when azoth rises?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T10:28:07-07:00","id":962357,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=962355#post962355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">wait,does disquiet gets stronger when azoth rises?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. Disquiet is a contest between your Azoth and the target's Resolve+Composure","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T10:31:16-07:00","id":962360,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=962355#post962355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">wait,does disquiet gets stronger when azoth rises?</div> </div> </div> </div>The roll is Azoth vs Resolve + Composure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T11:06:00-07:00","id":962376,"title":"","content":"I know I've said this a hundred times before, but Tommy Wiseau. His powers are truly formidable. <br /> <br /> To put it another way, despite not having completed a Pilgrimage, he's managed to amass a fortune, a circle of friends, fame, and his own movie. I always saw him as Phosphorum, but as one of the very few Phosphorum who didn't &quot;burn out&quot; but just kept going.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T14:04:05-07:00","id":962488,"title":"","content":"I think Lighthouse, who showed up in <b>Strange Alchemies</b>, would be an interesting Azoth 10 character. He'd be a fun reluctant bodhisattva.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T14:23:07-07:00","id":964524,"title":"","content":"I would really love to see Adam's write-up one day. Perhaps in a Night Horrors for Promethean? He probably isn't Azoth 10, but he's still a very interesting character.<br /> <br /> Sorry for not contributing much to the thread. I really would like to see a take on an Azoth 10 Promethean, but can't think of any right now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/196-max-deltree","name":"Max Deltree","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar196_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T14:29:34-07:00","id":964530,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Max Deltree</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=964524#post964524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would really love to see Adam's write-up one day. Perhaps in a Night Horrors for Promethean? He probably isn't Azoth 10, but he's still a very interesting character.<br /> <br /> Sorry for not contributing much to the thread. I really would like to see a take on an Azoth 10 Promethean, but can't think of any right now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I've actually been asking around about interest in a Night Horrors book for Promethean. I even have some people who say they might start it as a fan project, I could send PM you their info if you're interested.<br /> <br /> On thread topic, you can go the &quot;mysterious hermit&quot; route, but in a crossover game, it might be interesting to have a mastermind-y, long-term schemer type of Promethean. That's not usually a role they end up with, but it'd be cool to see one involved in the type of &quot;game of immortals&quot; that Vampires and Mummies do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5358,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","user":"Geckopirateship","date":". 09-06-2016, 05:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T14:34:32-07:00","id":964533,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Max Deltree</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=964524#post964524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would really love to see Adam's write-up one day. Perhaps in a Night Horrors for Promethean? He probably isn't Azoth 10, but he's still a very interesting character.<br /> <br /> Sorry for not contributing much to the thread. I really would like to see a take on an Azoth 10 Promethean, but can't think of any right now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'd like to do a Night Horrors book for PtC. If I get to, I'll make sure there's an Azoth 10 Promethean in there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T16:03:08-07:00","id":964596,"title":"","content":"What would an Azoth 10 Promethean do, if not advancing their milestones? I admit to not knowing much about Prometheans but it seems like the only universal tendencies they have is the Pilgrimage and making other Prometheans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T16:23:30-07:00","id":964609,"title":"","content":"Because he also happens to be a character in DC comics, I decided to stat up the Frankenstein Monster. About 3/4ths of the way through, I realized the outrageous side effects of Azoth 10. Considering I have him stalled on the Pilgrimage in the slums of the Metropolis, if he rejoins the Pilgrimage, he's going to Taint the entirety of new england. XD That's a scary thought. He's got quite a few calcified alembics, but he can't charge them without, again, yanking all of New England into a wasteland. So... despite his rather sizeable dice pools for most everything (Including a whopping +10 stamina on top of his already sizeable normal stamina.), hes actually.... rather useless lol. He has a hovel set up, where he spends his days drinking beer (its organic, so he can survive on beer alone) and watching reality TV shows.. Whenever he leaves, he jars half of his Azoth. He keeps some, just in case the Bride has found him. But really, he's stuck in a rut as a Copper Hermit, reminiscing about his days in the Creature Commandos and his friendship with Wonder Woman. His adopted &quot;kid&quot;, Wonder Girl, is trying to get him started on the Pilgrimage despite the..errr... side effects, and has enlisted a Lead Osirian to forge a Throng with him, her, the nepri, solomon grundy, and possibly clayface. Its a rather sad idea, though, that because of Azoth 10's side effects, he can't do much without causing electrical fires through the entire densely populated northeast. I have a hard time imagining when he'd ever actually use his full Azoth, as he relies on his Hovel and Dampening the Flame to prevent... ya know... a Firestorm or something. Azoth 10 is seriously scary. Not because of dice pools, but how ridiculous a wasteland they cause by spending one single Pyros. I suppose that's why his Pilgrimage kept sending him to the North Pole.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T16:32:28-07:00","id":964614,"title":"","content":"Well, if you want to stick with DC's version, he has spent a lot of time in abandoned castles, the arctic, and alone on Mars. Which would at least cause less problems with Disquiet than being in Metropolis.<br /> <br /> You have Solomon Grundy as a Nepri? Or was 'the nepri, solomon grundy' referring to two different characters?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T16:48:56-07:00","id":964628,"title":"","content":"You know, because a Wasteland Festers whenever one of its Festering Triggers comes along, an Azoth 10 Promethean really cutting loose doesn't, technically, need to leave those Wastelands they make sitting around for very long. In the space of a couple seconds they can start no less than three Firestorms at once. (They can spend 15 Pyros per turn, and need only five to bring it to a full Firestorm) Admittedly, that could conceivably give them, like, five Alembics for the scene, which could be insane.<br /> <br /> Alternatively, we could have an Azoth 10 Promethean who happens to have the Blaze of Glory Alembic from the Luciferus Transmutation available. They could conceivably unleash all of their 100 points of Pyros at once, causing no less than 20 hurricane-sized Firestorms at once. That... is not an experience most people would survive. Seriously, a Promethean that powerful could level a small country. The changes left in their wake would be indescribable. We're talking people suddenly swinging from normal to rabid and back again as Disquiet levels fluctuate, Prometheans (and possibly Vitriol Founts) flooding with the precious distillation of the Pilgrimage, Created, Pandorans, and/or Alchemists alike drowning in or stripped of Pyros. Every Pandoran in the country could die, every person in that radius could suddenly become incredibly physically hale or decrepit, and that <i>still </i>isn't factoring any collateral damage from the Firestorms themselves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T04:56:03-07:00","id":964898,"title":"","content":"Now THAT is a scary thought. It kinda makes you wonder if a Promethean at Azoth 10 had a role to play in a great natural disaster.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-08T01:44:24-07:00","id":965558,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=964614#post964614\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, if you want to stick with DC's version, he has spent a lot of time in abandoned castles, the arctic, and alone on Mars. Which would at least cause less problems with Disquiet than being in Metropolis.<br /> <br /> You have Solomon Grundy as a Nepri? Or was 'the nepri, solomon grundy' referring to two different characters?</div> </div> </div> </div>I haven't really used alien planets in my chronicle--so far, aliens are usually changelings (except Superboy, who I decided to use as a crossover for the then brand-new Exalted 3e.). But abandoned castles might work. He's been considering going fully nomadic, but sadly that'd take him out of the chronicle as the game is set entirely in that Metropolitan area. <br /> <br /> As for Grundy, no, those are two separate Created. Sadly, I'd already mined pretty much every single mummy, mummy-like, and immortal creature to use as Arisen by the time Prommie 2e came out, so Nepri is a relatively minor character from the comics named Smenkhkare. He was a relative/lover of Tut or Akhenaten based on my research, which fit nicely, since Tut is our token Deceived.<br /> <br /> Solomon Grundy is an extempore, who just one day got up out of the swamp and began his Pilgrimage. I tried to go for a somewhat more mainstream approach to his zombie status--his humor/element is related to plague and disease, his torment makes him almost mindless, and his bestowment is your typical zombie infectious bite that has a small chance to raise anyone killed by the disease as another zombie. He isn't Azoth 10. Though, he is still pretty scary.<br /> <br /> Adam Frankenstein, though... those firestorms and wastelands could easily kill everyone in metropolis. I figure the other Lineage Founders would be azoth 10 if the concept of them being immortal still stands (I assumed it didnt and that Galatea and Horus and Nepri died a looooong time ago and that Adam is nearing the end of his lifespan). <br /> <br /> Azoth 10 is a horrifying idea, really. These creatures would be hunted down by world governments, and require a lot of memory-editting from the God Machine just to explain away. I would imagine . Only 1 or 2 exist, and maybe 5 have EVER existed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-08T02:27:56-07:00","id":965568,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=964596#post964596\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What would an Azoth 10 Promethean do, if not advancing their milestones? I admit to not knowing much about Prometheans but it seems like the only universal tendencies they have is the Pilgrimage and making other Prometheans.</div> </div> </div> </div>Kind of a lot of things. I mentioned the idea of a Promethean playing supernatural politics, but there are plenty of other options. <br /> <br /> A Promethean could be pursuing a greater goal than humanity, for example. They could have come to terms with their existence, and are just living life. They might seek out some other goal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-08T07:03:42-07:00","id":965646,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/960290-pitch-me-your-azoth-10-prometheans?p=965568#post965568\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Kind of a lot of things. I mentioned the idea of a Promethean playing supernatural politics, but there are plenty of other options.<br /> <br /> A Promethean could be pursuing a greater goal than humanity, for example. They could have come to terms with their existence, and are just living life. They might seek out some other goal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or operate as a Promethean Bodhisattva, helping others complete <i>their</i> Pilgrimages.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-08T09:13:44-07:00","id":965713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div clas